github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103940","id":2712148698,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hqBra","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-11T00:26:26Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T00:26:26Z","body":"Hi Andrea, thank you for your report!\n\nUnfortunately, I don't think I can help with XWayland issues, as it's all X11 stuff behind the curtains, for which I have very little experience. XWayland is just a fancy X.Org server hooked up to the compositor and, for one reason or another, has quite a few quirks (see #78581).\n\n> Hello @Riteo, thank you for your work on Wayland.\n\nThank you for trying the Wayland backend! :D\n\n>  In the case of usefulness, can i help with more tests with Issues related to Wayland ?\n\nAll reports are appreciated, Wayland or not! If something is amiss with the native Wayland backend (\"Prefer Wayland\" on), I can very probably fix it myself quite quickly, or at least give further information on eventual blockers.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2712148698/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2714476485","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103940#issuecomment-2714476485","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103940","id":2714476485,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hy5_F","user":{"login":"AndreaMonzini","id":12413409,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDEzNDA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12413409?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini","html_url":"https://github.com/AndreaMonzini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndreaMonzini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-11T14:16:53Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T14:27:32Z","body":"Thank you for the quick answer !\n\nI just installed X11 in Fedora 41 / GNOME 47 with `sudo dnf install gnome-session-xsession`\nAnd i confirm that the issue disappears and the problem is Xwayland.\n\nI think that in long term the best strategy is to focus on Wayland ( so i will keep testing Wayland ).\n\nBut for now i have a workaround forcing X11 if i want to test ( without this Free Look issue ) the new `Embed Game` in 4.4 that is not available in Wayland.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2714476485/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]